        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 1449, 2-1/2  Inch Floor Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-1/2  inch high floor mounted door stop is made of solid brass by Don-Jo. This medium size floor mount door stop is typically used in both residential and commercial applications. Packaged complete with all installation hardware, available in 3 different finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-1449_size.gif?v=1704354708\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo 1449 Floor Door Stop size\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Shorter <a href=\"/products/1-5-8-inch-floor-door-stop-don-jo-1448\"><b>1-5/8 Inch Floor Door Stop</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo 1449 Floor Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Length: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Width: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Available Finishes: 3</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: (3) ea. 8/32 x 1\" Machine Screws, (3) ea. #8 x 1-1/4\" Sheet Metal Screws, (3) ea. Plastic Anchors, (3) ea. Lead Expansion Shields</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1449.pdf?v=1704262330\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 1449 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
